('getting-started','Take a complete tour of DRIGHT','tutorial-getting-started-01-take-a-complete-tour-of-dright','Step-by-step DRIGHT guide: Take a complete tour of DRIGHT.','<h2>Take a complete tour of DRIGHT</h2><p>Step-by-step DRIGHT guide: Take a complete tour of DRIGHT.</p><ol><li>Open the relevant getting started area from DRIGHT navigation.</li><li>Review the current on-screen requirements and any eligibility message before continuing.</li><li>Complete the action using the buttons and forms shown in DRIGHT; do not move sensitive payment or verification steps off platform.</li><li>Confirm the resulting status, progress, transaction or listing record before repeating the action.</li><li>If the result differs from what you expect, use Help Center or the matching support channel with the relevant DRIGHT reference.</li></ol><h3>Tip</h3><p>DRIGHT settings can be changed by administrators, so always treat the values and requirements displayed in your account as the current source of truth.</p>',3,'beginner',1),
